# Writing Skills

Purpose:
  Text production and hygiene skills: user-facing text cleanup,
  provenance-mark handling, and document co-authoring patterns.

Owns: ./

Skills:
  clean-user-facing-text:
    source: https://github.com/guillaumemeyer/watermarks-remover
    imported: 2026-09-06
    purpose: Clean owned prose while preserving facts, meaning, voice
    runtime: python3 (Docker-gated)
  remove-ai-marks:
    source: https://github.com/guillaumemeyer/watermarks-remover
    imported: 2026-09-06
    purpose: Multi-vendor AI provenance-mark removal (thin client, Docker service)
    runtime: docker (HTTP service via curl)

Rules:
  [W1] Writing skills MUST preserve facts, claims, numbers, citations.
  [W2] Cleaning scripts MUST run inside Docker ([R59]-[R66]).
  [W3] Use only for text/files the user owns or is authorized to process.

Navigation:
  SkillsIndex: @../INDEX.sdd
  CleanUserFacingText: @clean-user-facing-text/INDEX.sdd
  RemoveAIMarks: @remove-ai-marks/INDEX.sdd
  PurgeCommand: @../../../commands/sdd-purge.sdd

State: +
